{
  "id": "v3.managed_restart",
  "version": "3",
  "description": "受管重启对象流：从 restart-intent 到 restart-outcome 的固定五节点 SESE 主链。本图只声明生命周期控制与发布边界，不承载请求/响应业务流；admin_webui 是可选附属监听，生命周期端口可用性、陈旧发现、跨实例释放与残留 PID 扫描仅针对业务 listeners。",
  "inputs": [{"id": "restart-intent", "schema": "Object"}],
  "nodes": [
    {"id": "prepare_previous_release_transfer", "operator": "routecodex.v3.lifecycle.prepare_previous_release_restart_transfer", "operator_version": "1", "inputs": ["restart-intent"], "output": {"id": "verified-transfer-intent", "schema": "Object"}, "input_selector": {"include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null}, "output_selector": {"include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null}, "iterator": "Whole", "resources": {"reads": ["v3.lifecycle.instance_declaration", "v3.lifecycle.pid_cache", "v3.lifecycle.control_channel", "v3.lifecycle.hooks_sidecar_process"], "writes": ["v3.lifecycle.previous_release_restart_transfer"]}, "notes": "上一发布代际交接只读取实例与 PID 控制真源；declaration.listeners 保持完整序列化（含 admin_webui），用于跨版本精确匹配，不在本节点拆分或丢弃监听声明。"},
    {"id": "control_identity", "operator": "routecodex.v3.lifecycle.send_restart_control", "operator_version": "1", "inputs": ["verified-transfer-intent"], "output": {"id": "owner-bound-plan", "schema": "Object"}, "input_selector": {"include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null}, "output_selector": {"include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null}, "iterator": "Whole", "resources": {"reads": ["v3.lifecycle.instance_declaration", "v3.lifecycle.control_channel"], "writes": ["v3.lifecycle.restart_plan"]}, "notes": "把验证后的交接意图绑定到唯一 owner 与 nonce 化 restart plan；不发布监听，不评估端口可用性。"},
    {"id": "prepare_or_reject", "operator": "routecodex.v3.lifecycle.control_restart_plan", "operator_version": "1", "inputs": ["owner-bound-plan"], "output": {"id": "prepared-or-rejected", "schema": "Object"}, "input_selector": {"include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null}, "output_selector": {"include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null}, "iterator": "Whole", "resources": {"reads": ["v3.lifecycle.restart_plan"], "writes": []}, "notes": "准备或拒绝 restart plan 时，端口可用性、占用端口采集、跨实例重叠释放与残留 PID/陈旧状态发现均只针对业务 listeners（server_id != \"admin_webui\"）；admin-only foreign PID 不会被发现、收割或被发送信号。declaration.listeners 仍完整保留 admin_webui 序列化；显式 PID 端口范围守卫只作用于业务目标端口集合。"},
    {"id": "exec_accepted_plan", "operator": "routecodex.v3.lifecycle.restart_managed_runtime_in_place", "operator_version": "1", "inputs": ["prepared-or-rejected"], "output": {"id": "exec-or-retained-owner", "schema": "Object"}, "input_selector": {"include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null}, "output_selector": {"include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null}, "iterator": "Whole", "resources": {"reads": ["v3.lifecycle.instance_declaration", "v3.lifecycle.pid_cache", "v3.lifecycle.control_channel", "v3.front.runtime_handoff_checkpoint", "v3.lifecycle.exec_restart_artifacts", "v3.lifecycle.previous_release_restart_transfer", "v3.lifecycle.hooks_sidecar_process"], "writes": ["v3.lifecycle.exec_restart_artifacts", "v3.lifecycle.previous_release_restart_transfer"]}, "notes": "执行已接受的 restart plan 或保留原 owner；在 exec/release 边界同样不把 admin_webui 端口当作业务占用，admin-only 进程不属于业务抢占目标。"},
    {"id": "publish_exact_owner_outcome", "operator": "routecodex.v3.lifecycle.V3ManagedLifecycle::run_managed_child_with_declaration", "operator_version": "1", "inputs": ["exec-or-retained-owner"], "output": {"id": "restart-outcome", "schema": "Object"}, "input_selector": {"include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null}, "output_selector": {"include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null}, "iterator": "Whole", "resources": {"reads": ["v3.lifecycle.exec_restart_artifacts", "v3.lifecycle.previous_release_restart_transfer", "v3.lifecycle.instance_declaration", "v3.lifecycle.pid_cache", "v3.lifecycle.control_channel"], "writes": ["v3.lifecycle.instance_declaration", "v3.lifecycle.pid_cache", "v3.lifecycle.control_channel", "v3.lifecycle.exec_restart_artifacts", "v3.lifecycle.previous_release_restart_transfer"]}, "notes": "以完整 declaration 启动子进程并发布唯一 owner 结果：admin_webui 是可选附属监听，config 缺失、解析失败或绑定失败时显式告警并跳过 admin router、AppState/background 注册与 listener task，绝不回滚已绑定的业务 listeners；业务监听真实端口冲突仍显式失败。"}
  ],
  "edges": [
    {"from": "prepare_previous_release_transfer", "to": "control_identity", "arc_id": "verified-transfer-intent"},
    {"from": "control_identity", "to": "prepare_or_reject", "arc_id": "owner-bound-plan"},
    {"from": "prepare_or_reject", "to": "exec_accepted_plan", "arc_id": "prepared-or-rejected"},
    {"from": "exec_accepted_plan", "to": "publish_exact_owner_outcome", "arc_id": "exec-or-retained-owner"}
  ],
  "outputs": ["restart-outcome"],
  "invariants": [
    "生命周期端口可用性、陈旧发现、跨实例释放与残留 PID 扫描仅针对业务 listeners（server_id != \"admin_webui\"）；admin-only foreign PID 永远不进入被接管、收割或信号范围。",
    "run_managed_child_with_declaration 启动 Server aggregate 时，admin_webui 被视为可选附属监听：失败显式告警并跳过 admin router/background 注册，不回滚业务 listeners；业务 listener 真实端口冲突显式失败。",
    "declaration.listeners 完整保留 admin_webui 序列化，维护 instance.json 与 PreviousReleaseRestartTransfer 的跨版本精确匹配；不得删除该条目来绕开发现范围问题。",
    "显式 PID 端口范围守卫（guard_explicit_listener_pids_are_scoped_to_target_ports）原样保留，仅对业务目标端口集合允许显式 PID 信号收割。"
  ]
}
